[{"title":"同林九高二傅二施二避暑越王城楼","author":"郑善夫","text":"长夏升炎䓇，高城遁郁蒸。\n河隍虚雉堞，云日造松陵。\n不去稽康达，同游贾岛能。\n愧无邻舍酒，率尔集良朋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见二毛","author":"郑善夫","text":"去国星霜变，违时老惫成。\n荒迷一身在，汨没二毛生。\n世短思飞舄，途穷乞步兵。\n昏尘干气象，沟壑未忘情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将别","author":"郑善夫","text":"多事晋安郡，浮生未息机。\n草堂存下着，花径罢初衣。\n江海形容在，君王梦寐稀。\n隆中弃汝去，勋业愿无违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白袍","author":"郑善夫","text":"白袍存皎洁，傍尔竹林人。\n安得绿玉杖，长随乌角巾。\n庄生书是愤，阮瑀行能纯。\n易俗吾奚敢，将无养道真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜热次林九 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"中宵犹酷热，初伏未秋风。\n汲井分寒水，休灯散羽虫。\n宦情深自损，肺气更相攻。\n象魏天萧爽，衣冠日会同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜热次林九 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"雷霆悭小雨，岩谷断微风。\n北雪阴山里，南州大火中。\n迎秋草木异，爱月女儿同。\n内热兼多病，赓歌愧未工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹青阁","author":"郑善夫","text":"建州丹青阁，清切建城西。\n云栈浮高壁，风松出逶溪。\n水枯沙漠漠，秋晏树凄凄。\n多垒关山里，销忧聊杖藜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登建州浮屠访僧道林","author":"郑善夫","text":"浮屠秋独立，千里见氛祲。\n水阁风长盛，山城日易阴。\n赤霞留鹤晚，黄叶住僧深。\n世事宜高卧，空惭支遁林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游陶园","author":"郑善夫","text":"太仆遗荣在，黄华晚见招。\n凿池旋日月，洗竹直云霄。\n宾客时能至，园林迹许遥。\n高秋花杂沓，胜地不萧条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19493,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮秋","author":"郑善夫","text":"旅情秋又暮，长路更旌旗。\n王气平三极，兵尘黯四夷。\n拙惭名已晚，病恐志将衰。\n许国微躯在，崎危善自持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19494,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸿雁","author":"郑善夫","text":"稻粱荒岁月，鸿雁散江湖。\n避地风霜切，防身机辟俱。\n不愁天旷绝，长恐事荣枯。\n二月阴山暖，归心慰远途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19495,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北征","author":"郑善夫","text":"五年归少谷，万里赴燕台。\n恋阙鬓毛改，感时鸿雁来。\n鱼龙已寂寞，江汉尚喧豗。\n远愧青莲士，君王爱尔才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19496,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"章滩","author":"郑善夫","text":"九月章滩水，危于滟滪堆。\n黄郎习波浪，白日犯风雷。\n鸟兽曾何有，蛟龙或上来。\n畏途荆棘暗，此地石门开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19497,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆四弟二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"出门忧汝病，清泪至今垂。\n鸿雁莽相失，脊令空尔思。\n未依南郭隐，真怪北山移。\n夜雨灯明里，商歌一拊髀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19498,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆四弟二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"驽马心犹壮，龙驹产不虚。\n吾衰今更去，汝病近何如。\n烽火淹鱼素，关山沓羽书。\n横门思一出，此意几踌躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19499,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崙溪对芙蓉怀林九王七","author":"郑善夫","text":"脉脉崙溪雨，芙蓉傲远天。\n时危花烂熳，岁晚叶逡巡。\n对影会相忆，看他亦自怜。\n秋容长不灭，吾欲赠佳人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19500,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄宗吕","author":"郑善夫","text":"高适不早达，才多数亦奇。\n名应造化忌，狂与世人疑。\n妻子已同志，箪瓢长自怡。\n箕山好风月，将汝结茅茨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19501,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄林惟大","author":"郑善夫","text":"不了林和靖，遐心驻薜萝。\n星文天上有，书法世间多。\n独鹤闻清夜，疏梅渡暗波。\n沧湾馀故宅，猿鸟近如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19502,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆道夫","author":"郑善夫","text":"玉山建亥月，漫忆十年前。\n旧驿同吟雪，诸君尽着鞭。\n客途犹战伐，南楚自风烟。\n异域怀知己，沈沦尔最贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19503,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄木虚","author":"郑善夫","text":"吾弟知名早，锋棱不可当。\n交情有端复，文体下齐梁。\n霜骥时犹蹶，风鹰势必扬。\n嵩山读书处，烟雨压茅堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19504,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后陪周用宾杖策寻天目祖花","author":"郑善夫","text":"风雨于潜道，藤萝古殿阴。\n祖花传近代，瑶草寄遐心。\n应世吾能赋，探玄女独深。\n形骸百鍊晚，未免二毛侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19505,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中对孙太初食黄精","author":"郑善夫","text":"山中黄精熟，作意向山人。\n制法随蒸曝，灵根集鬼神。\n腹心吾尚病，服食尔能纯。\n有客乘云气，三尸不累身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19506,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月朔日登西天目看高峰中峰二神僧祖塔因晀千丈岩寻雷起处折古松枝扣巨石长啸天风蓬蓬从谷底起偃仆草木投宿张公洞枕上漫尔成诗","author":"郑善夫","text":"汨汨衰双鬓，迢迢向两峰。\n一尘消未了，万劫入无穷。\n昧谷蛟龙雨，玄冥草木风。\n自惭增上慢，吁骇问崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19507,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮寻天台山水","author":"郑善夫","text":"桃源未可极，天台烟雾深。\n行歌白雪调，坐见赤霞心。\n草次千峰会，鸿蒙万壑阴。\n藏身一大事，聊观世人音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19508,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"台州观海二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"独客长途破，孤城幽思多。\n入山忘日月，观海失江河。\n万事只垂钓，故园未偃戈。\n平生挟弧矢，流落意如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19509,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"台州观海二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"迷阳不自觉，春远此登楼。\n落日鲲鹏运，一桴天地浮。\n白波心不变，青鸟信何由。\n八骏浮云里，平居端百忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19510,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁宕读壁间诗侯希召云此陈准卿之作也昔与准卿为月夜游仰观天柱诸峰岌岌如坠发狂大叫自以为奇观今兹已矣相顾欷歔赋此酹之","author":"郑善夫","text":"雁荡清猿夜，黯然读尔诗。\n斯人竟短折，吾道日支离。\n二谷看秋月，孤峰落酒卮。\n细翻嘉树传，洒泣向临菑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19511,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观雁宕龙湫","author":"郑善夫","text":"瀑布飞不彻，大声空谷哀。\n青山下河汉，白日莽风雷。\n潭稳蛟龙定，岁深鸿雁来。\n方岩倚天畔，吾志在崔嵬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19512,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘令席上作军中乐","author":"郑善夫","text":"张筵潘岳县，笳鼓竞黄昏。\n杨柳生南国，风云动塞垣。\n挥戈情可念，击楫气犹存。\n汉主白登道，甘心出玉门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19513,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠顾华玉太守","author":"郑善夫","text":"客有飘飘者，朅来湖海游。\n云端寻雁荡，雪里过台州。\n白业藏贤达，浮槎近女牛。\n丰干漫饶舌，太守是闾丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19514,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋燕集答华玉二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"赤城天欲雪，岁暮客边心。\n君子风骚远，良宵尊俎深。\n旅怀新浩荡，时事向萧森。\n作意依刘表，移家近汉阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19515,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋燕集答华玉二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"梁园初授简，越客罢鸣琴。\n节序梅花及，江湖鸿雁深。\n雪歌难却和，醴酒若为斟。\n何限山阴兴，幽居独许寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19516,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日发赤城","author":"郑善夫","text":"碧海春信至，赤城愁思深。\n雪晴千涧疾，日落万方阴。\n毕岁皆行役，凡躯故滞淫。\n西归负良友，忽尔长蓬心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19517,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浙江别王崇贤","author":"郑善夫","text":"避乱安平镇，逢君永夜船。\n何堪萍水迹，直落浙江边。\n天子今巡幸，崆峒积岁年。\n忧心正如捣，况听卜居篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19518,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上赠汝厉侍御之荆湖","author":"郑善夫","text":"浙水重逢地，闽州旧话稠。\n雷霆喧独夜，风雨动三秋。\n骐骥行堪见，鹰鹯击更优。\n他时有谏草，知上岳阳楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19519,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登太山日观峰","author":"郑善夫","text":"东岳乾坤定，黄河一缕分。\n日排瀛海浪，天入蓟门云。\n鲁道伤吾志，秦碑自夕曛。\n未堪疏远目，万里正䘲氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19520,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁","author":"郑善夫","text":"问途青草坂，捩柂白榆林。\n暑雨东方急，河泥五月深。\n低回长弃马，淹泊未栖禽。\n商调何悲切，从谁觅赏音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19521,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北风","author":"郑善夫","text":"北风天际下，舟楫夜相闻。\n白草悬边月，黄沙长塞云。\n鸾旂犹小队，虎旅尽高勋。\n崖崿暌乖久，人今已勒文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19522,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隐忧","author":"郑善夫","text":"四海俱疲敝，中原且力支。\n路难惟蹭蹬，心苦有栖迟。\n草泽龙初斗，天山矢更遗。\n无由济社稷，哽咽送年衰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19523,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出门","author":"郑善夫","text":"去国淹年岁，出门仍糺纷。\n未回塞翁马，空有野人芹。\n山海随黄纛，风云驻五军。\n远惭东方朔，谈笑诤明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19524,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大田篇二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"内使调鹰犬，呼声动远陲。\n万方多事后，千骑大田时。\n关塞回金气，旌麾把健儿。\n璜溪垂钓者，能载副车来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19525,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大田篇二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"禁直三千士，长搴镇国旗。\n甲戈迷塞月，缯帛款边师。\n大礼初回跸，春原更打围。\n后车载光宠，不数汉昭仪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19526,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦惟可为余作山中草堂","author":"郑善夫","text":"天末梦君子，山中营我庐。\n江湖无利涉，家室且安居。\n梅福机事早，郑虔生计疏。\n京尘今始便，骑马亦樵渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19527,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪希会还武昌题得彭蠡","author":"郑善夫","text":"彭蠡何时定，康郎水尚多。\n鱼龙冬不蛰，日月岁相摩。\n楚客思芳草，江城未凯歌。\n星樯候风色，安稳犯鲸波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19528,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄岩黄宗贤为余筑室羽山招与共栖未果守官郁郁辄有东路之思奈故乡多难欲归不可行当赴其招矣记兴二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"万事无何有，风云信所为。\n此生依鲍叔，何处觅钟期。\n騕袅怀长路，芙蓉惜后时。\n嗣宗元玩世，不恨步兵迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19529,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答孙太初","author":"郑善夫","text":"平生孙处士，云水谊难忘。\n遁世思公辈，卜居真此乡。\n名高多寂寞，道在亦翱翔。\n徐福终入海，蓬莱意甚长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19530,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答林德敷","author":"郑善夫","text":"曼倩淹平世，扬云困太玄。\n此生元濩落，夫子最相怜。\n迹逐捐金市，心卑扣角篇。\n鲵桓去不远，脱屣岁寒天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19531,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下听王稚钦弹琴","author":"郑善夫","text":"昭文鼓绿绮，六气指间流。\n王子梅花思，飘飘下陇头。\n月华终胜雪，商意自成秋。\n今夕西方梦，佳人不散忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19532,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈生赴韶州戎幕三首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"闽海三山下，韶州五岭南。\n东风鹢首去，长路马蹄谙。\n蛮井歌堪听，军门剑可谈。\n丹砂真易得，吾欲解朝簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19533,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈生赴韶州戎幕三首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"月下栖乌树，天边过雁群。\n生涯随逆旅，幽独倍怜君。\n百粤兹多难，今时未尚文。\n南游得蛮府，愁杀郝参军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19534,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈生赴韶州戎幕三首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"已息河间辔，仍麾岭外旌。\n艰危一命寄，牢落二毛生。\n铜柱时存汉，乌蛮岁厉兵。\n凭将攻守策，忼慨说花卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19535,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读魏钰诗","author":"郑善夫","text":"魏钰新声出，篇篇有古风。\n夜珠光照乘，天马势行空。\n邑宰深相识，经生本自穷。\n昆城依隐地，秪忆鹿皮翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19536,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边将","author":"郑善夫","text":"十月黄沙动，阴山白雪高。\n边兵凭剽杀，汉马辟雄豪。\n王道须无外，天戈自有操。\n莫令耕稼地，岁岁泣弓刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19537,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄徐可大黄门","author":"郑善夫","text":"往年游白下，汎爱有徐卿。\n令弟今相问，怜君久振缨。\n岁星还自照，谏草未全行。\n谢傅东山卧，秋风社稷情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19538,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪令希舜","author":"郑善夫","text":"彭门当太白，剑阁带青城。\n此地神仙窟，春风枳棘情。\n桃花栽欲遍，蜀道去还平。\n知尔丹成日，双凫凌紫清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19539,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游衡山","author":"郑善夫","text":"衡山开汉沔，高者祝融峰。\n羡尔为官地，看云长道容。\n斋居梦波浪，冬日见鱼龙。\n定有冥栖客，巢君紫盖松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19540,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龙相赴荣府","author":"郑善夫","text":"去为朱履客，潇洒向王门。\n君有神仙质，官曹入故园。\n乘风帝子阁，种术武陵源。\n莫吊长沙傅，荆蛮处处猿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19541,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鹤","author":"郑善夫","text":"广野声仍度，华轩意不忘。\n只疑霄汉远，其奈网罗长。\n宿处随鸳鹭，鸣时学凤凰。\n终当蓬阙去，天路永翱翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19542,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜过王稚钦","author":"郑善夫","text":"禁木栖乌尽，城楼戍鼓催。\n瞑移中散驾，时接仲宣才。\n道术吾全未，词场力拟回。\n清风广陵散，爱尔数能来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19543,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠宋鸿","author":"郑善夫","text":"怜君羽翼晚，矫矫若惊鸿。\n夜蹑燕山雪，春生楚泽风。\n霄汉去不极，稻粱行当逢。\n遐方倦飞鸟，犹自触樊笼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏仲昭画竹","author":"郑善夫","text":"苍梧春欲至，翠篁风雨深。\n云梢洒不乱，流影下湘阴。\n杳矣虞妃泪，悠哉君子心。\n凤凰去已久，对尔想遗音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日得诸友书六首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"岁晚通明阁，登临念我深。\n故山归未得，丛桂蔚森森。\n人日双鱼信，远天黄鸟音。\n如何庄舄贵，翻动越乡吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日得诸友书六首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"闻尔浮南海，鲸波隔岁回。\n翻将谢傅兴，转作步兵哀。\n地到朱方尽，舟从日下来。\n交州拾薏苡，谁识葛仙才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日得诸友书六首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"吾爱方山老，岩崖湛世情。\n成都卖卜久，不道是君平。\n文陋齐梁体，音收正始名。\n赤霄天骥步，他日与横行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日得诸友书六首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"女方寻九鲤，余苦忆丹丘。\n蓂荚生无尽，璚花采末由。\n兔园枚叔侍，牛渚客星浮。\n杳杳孤槎外，相思天汉流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日得诸友书六首 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"不跨山公马，春今薛老峰。\n前时紫芝曲，尚绕白云中。\n霄汉惭栖棘，泥沙想蛰龙。\n明朝解组去，共醉薜萝丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日得诸友书六首 其六","author":"郑善夫","text":"尔同邺下士，染翰擅词场。\n余岂东方朔，犹含汉署香。\n放身沧海上，得句白莲塘。\n迟暮思君子，春来数雁行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游邺下","author":"郑善夫","text":"邺城魏七子，文藻亦吾师。\n四牡君今去，风流端在兹。\n荒芜铜雀榭，寂寞武安祠。\n独有韩陵石，黄沙岁岁吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"部直","author":"郑善夫","text":"春怀耿不寐，怅望宛京天。\n鹤到中宵唳，星分万井悬。\n燕云时少耗，郊禘日虚传。\n常想南昌尉，先存谏诤笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]